+	/*!
+	 * Finishes a position that is about to be reported.
+	 *
+	 * The tilt offset is added, and a pen that does not move is held in place
+	 * (JitterRadius while in contact, HoverJitterRadius while hovering).
+	 *
+	 * @param[in,out] x The X coordinate, in the range 0 to 1.
+	 * @param[in,out] y The Y coordinate, in the range 0 to 1.
